MEDICAL DISCLAIMER

My Care is a triage decision-support tool. It does not provide medical
diagnoses, prescriptions, or laboratory evaluation, and it is not a substitute
for professional medical care. It is designed for adults (18+) only and
excludes pediatric, mental health, and chronic disease management. Anyone
deploying this software is responsible for having its rule set reviewed and
approved by qualified health professionals for their local clinical context.
